To find how many minutes it will take for the printer to print 200 pages, we can use the formula:

\[
\text{Time} = \frac{\text{Total Pages}}{\text{Pages per Minute}}
\]

\[
\text{Time} = \frac{200}{17} \approx 11.7647 \text{ minutes}
\]

Rounding 11.7647 to the nearest whole number gives 12 minutes.

